# Link exclusions for lychee. Each pattern is a regular expression.
# Every pattern needs a "# reason:" comment on the line above it, and any change
# to this file needs approval from a docs maintainer (see CONTRIBUTING.md).

# reason: API base URLs that return 404 or 401 without a request path and token
^https://api(\.eu)?\.trustauthority\.intel\.com
# reason: Portal sign-in pages that redirect to authentication and block bots
^https://portal(\.eu)?\.trustauthority\.intel\.com
# reason: LinkedIn returns HTTP 999 to automated clients even for valid profiles
^https://www\.linkedin\.com/
